  "body": "What happens: the post-merge batch gate fails on main at `af83da0f4`. Run 43813475222, job `gate`, step \"Batch gate tier\": FAIL in 140 s. One test fails: `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::safety::post_confirmation_allow_and_deny_gate_mcp_dispatch` (ui suites, cwd crates/ui). All other lanes passed.\n\nExpected: every batch-tier lane passes on main.\n\nEvidence: run https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/43813475222 . The previous main `98f093fba` was green (run 43806830169). The delta is the merge batch `af83da0f4`: PR #2102 (edge-break gouge credit, crates/cl) and PR #2120 (Sodick four-axis post, crates/post + assets/posts). Start by running the test on a branch off main, then bisect between `98f093fba` and `af83da0f4`.\n\nFound while: watching run 43813475222 (maintenance lane).\n\nDone means: the test passes on a pushed branch off current main, the fix merges, and the next post-merge run is green.\n",
